 "answer_verbatim": "There isn’t one objectively “best” roofer, but **New View Roofing** looks like a strong Dallas-area option: one recent comparison lists it at **4.9 stars from about 700 reviews**, and customer feedback highlights clear explanations and attentive service.\n\nI’d also get bids from **T Rock Roofing & Contracting** and **Shepherd Roofing & Renovations** before deciding. Rankings vary by source, so compare the actual proposals—not just star ratings. Ask each company for:\n\n- A detailed, itemized scope and price\n- Proof of insurance and local references\n- Written workmanship and manufacturer warranties\n- Who will supervise the job and handle cleanup\n- Confirmation that any needed permits will be obtained\n\nGet at least three written estimates, and be cautious of high-pressure sales tactics or anyone promising to waive your insurance deductible.",
